 "general_instructions": "Please choose every label yourself, without AI assistance; comments are optional. Thank you for labelling these 84 short items; it takes about 40 minutes. In the first kind of item you see two chatbot replies and decide which one is written in a more formal style, judging only the style and not the content. In the second kind you see a short text and the description of one feature of English, and decide whether the feature occurs in the text at least once. Nothing in the items tells you what the answer should be and there are no trick items. If you cannot decide, choose 'About the same' or 'Unsure' and move on. Please do not look anything up and do not go back to change earlier answers.",
